<title>INDIA: India to sell 600,000 T wheat per month in Dec-Mar.</title>
<headline>India to sell 600,000 T wheat per month in Dec-Mar.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian government has decided to release 600,000 tonnes of wheat per month for open domestic sales during December 1996 and March 1997, a food ministry statement said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
